{"ticker":"CIPLA","symbol":"CIPLA","instrumentId":3022391,"name":"Cipla","industry":"NSE-Medical-Generic Drugs","about":"Cipla Ltd., is a trusted global pharmaceutical company dedicated to \"Caring for Life.\" With operations in 80+ countries, Cipla offers a comprehensive portfolio of over 1,500 products across various therapeutic categories and 50+ dosage forms. Cipla is renowned for its compassionate approach to healthcare, exemplified by its paradigm-shifting offer of a triple anti-retroviral therapy for HIV/AIDS in Africa at less than a dollar a day in 2001. The company is also a leader in respiratory care, striving to become a global lung leader while ensuring access to high-quality medicines and sustainable healthcare solutions.","website":"www.cipla.com","location":"Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:12:56.193Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1418.5,"changePct":0.1058574453069866,"week52High":1531.3,"week52Low":1192.4},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,14,599 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹28,139 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"573,600,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"939"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"444,608,418"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.92%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.33"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"0.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.48"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"13%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"39.55"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"22–41"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"11.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"48.78"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,098,282"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,220,666"},{"label":"Master score","value":"50"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"34"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"60"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"31"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"B+"}],"earningsAnnual":{"headers":["Year","EPS (₹)","Sales (₹